["11:00"]={"By \00311 o’clock\004 I have finished the first chapter of Mr. Y. The winter sun is peeping meekly through the thin curtains and I decide to get up.","The End of Mr. Y","Scarlett Thomas"},
["11:01"]={"On went the hands of the clock. At one minute to eleven all was peaceful and orderly. At eleven the masters departed for the usual brief interval. At \003one minute past eleven\004 all was war and tumult!","Jack of Both Sides: The Story of a School War","Florence Coombe"},
["11:02"]={"“Yes.” Perena’s firm tone brooked no argument. “It exploded at 11:07. You would have entered at \00311:02\004, so that by then you would have been exactly midway between the Gates.”","The Shadow and Night","Chris Walley"},
